ind":"announcement","title":"Co-op is now live in our Demo!","summary":"Not much to say other than...CO-OP IS LIVE IN OUR DEMO NOW!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T19:21:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389808","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922730-1845383656382941","game_id":"steam-4922730","kind":"update","title":"Major Update - Player Feedback Improvements","summary":"Hello Everyone! We take feedback seriously, and by we, I mean I do. As a Solo Dev feedback is everything. Well I cant take every suggestion or issue and make it a reality I do listen to everything reported, said, and do my best to address it if applicable. With that said I've taken some time back and thought about the consistent feedback I'm receiving. Overall I've received overwhelming praise for the game establishing it's own footing in the survivorlike/bonklike universe. But, there has been i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:07:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656382941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922730-1840944183787261","game_id":"steam-4922730","kind":"announcement","title":"ScreenRant Left us an Incredible Review!","summary":"As a small indie dev, I never thought 10 people would want to play my game, let alone 1,100 wishlists and growing.But I've been humbled. Send Them to Hell has received nothing but praise, positivity and is slowly growing a dedicated fanbase, and we aren't even released yet!Fans have given it praise for its addictive playstyle, unique content, and overly done QoL and accessibility options. With that said, I am so deeply honored that ScreenRant reached out after hearing about our game and left suc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T21:04:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787261","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922730-1840944183774643","game_id":"steam-4922730","kind":"announcement","title":"1000 Wishlists! 🎉🥳","summary":"OMG! Massive thanks from Sojaplin Studios to everyone who wishlisted Send Them to Hell! To some this might not be a massive milestone but to myself and the very small team I have helping me the fact that 1000 people would considering buying, or play this game is just so tear jerking. Like honestly I want to cry. I'm not even going to spell check or format this. This is a heart and soul post. THANK YOU! Next friday is our Steam public playtest! You'll see that request access button on the games p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T17:42:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774643","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922730-1839676055887452","game_id":"steam-4922730","kind":"update","title":"Discord Update & 100 Wishlists!","summary":"THANK YOU FOR 100 WISHLISTS!I know 100 wishlists might not seem like a huge milestone to some, but as a solo developer, it means the world to me. Creating Send Them to Hell has been an uphill battle. There have been plenty of late nights, setbacks, and moments where I questioned whether I'd ever get here. Knowing that 100 people are excited enough to wishlist the game is honestly surreal.Thank you. Seriously. My next goal is 500 wishlists. After that... I honestly have no idea. I'll probably jus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T08:12:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922730-1839041357028690","game_id":"steam-4922730","kind":"announcement","title":"Wishlist Now and lookout for our upcoming Playtest in August!","summary":"Hello Everyone! We released our Official Reveal Trailer and are so excited for these next few months before release. Send Them to Hell is aiming for an end of October release and we will update everyone when we get that locked in! With that said we are also getting ready to open up our doors for feedback in August. You'll be able to test out Endless Mode on the first two levels Forest and Tundra. These will be playable in Solo and Co-op. So make sure you Wishlist and follow for updates and be su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T06:52:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357028690","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4922730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4922730":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4922730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5129630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:29:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4922730","app_id":4922730,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","la